#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:321
msgid ""
"No checkpoints yet. One is taken automatically before mutating WP-CLI "
"commands and plugin & theme updates."
msgstr ""
"Nessun checkpoint per ora. Ne viene creato uno automaticamente prima dei "
"comandi WP-CLI che modificano i dati e degli aggiornamenti di plugin e temi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:321
msgid ""
"Restoring a checkpoint rewrites every site table. A pre-restore safety "
"checkpoint is taken first."
msgstr ""
"Il ripristino di un checkpoint riscrive tutte le tabelle del sito. Prima "
"viene creato un checkpoint di sicurezza."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:325
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:326
msgid "Label (optional)"
msgstr "Etichetta (facoltativa)"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:327
msgid "Create checkpoint now"
msgstr "Crea checkpoint ora"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:335
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1468
msgid "Created"
msgstr "Creazione"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:336
msgid "Label"
msgstr "Etichetta"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:337
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Trigger"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:338
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Dimensione"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:339
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1470
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Azioni"

#. translators: 1: checkpoint ID number, 2: checkpoint creation date/time
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:352
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Restore the database to checkpoint #%1$s (%2$s)? EVERYTHING changed since "
"then — including changes made outside MCP — will be lost. A pre-restore "
"safety checkpoint is taken first."
msgstr ""
"Ripristinare il database al checkpoint n. %1$s (%2$s)? TUTTO ciò che è "
"cambiato da quel momento — comprese le modifiche apportate al di fuori di "
"MCP — andrà perso. Viene prima creato un checkpoint di sicurezza pre-"
"ripristino."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:353
msgid "Really sure? This rewrites every site table."
msgstr ""
"Procedere davvero? Questa operazione riscrive tutte le tabelle del sito."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:353
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:356
msgid "Restore"
msgstr "Ripristina"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:358
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:361
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Elimina"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-activity.php:358
msgid "Delete this checkpoint?"
msgstr "Eliminare questo checkpoint?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:29
msgid "the app"
msgstr "l’app"

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Claude Code
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:111
#, php-format
msgid "%s found your site — approve access on the sign-in page."
msgstr "%s ha trovato il tuo sito — approva l’accesso nella pagina di accesso."

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Claude Code
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:114
#, php-format
msgid "Approved — waiting for the first request from %s."
msgstr "Approvato — in attesa della prima richiesta di %s."

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Claude Code
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:118
#, php-format
msgid "✓ Connected — %s reused your earlier connection."
msgstr "✓ Connesso — %s ha riutilizzato la tua connessione precedente."

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Claude Code
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:121
#, php-format
msgid "✓ Connected — %s can now use this site."
msgstr "✓ Connesso — %s può ora usare questo sito."

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Claude Code
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:124
#, php-format
msgid "%s tried to connect, but new connections were off."
msgstr ""
"%s ha provato a connettersi, ma le nuove connessioni erano disattivate."

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Claude Code
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "Waiting for %s…"
msgstr "In attesa di %s…"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:141
msgid "Refresh list"
msgstr "Aggiorna elenco"

#. translators: %s: countdown such as 29:59
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:146
#, php-format
msgid "New connections open · %s left"
msgstr "Nuove connessioni aperte · %s rimanenti"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:150
msgid "Turn off"
msgstr "Disattiva"

#. translators: %s: countdown such as 29:59
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:231
#, php-format
msgid "New connections are on (%s left)."
msgstr "Le nuove connessioni sono attive (%s rimanenti)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:239
msgid "Turn on new connections first:"
msgstr "Attivare prima le nuove connessioni:"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:240
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:1254
msgid "Enable for 30 minutes"
msgstr "Attiva per 30 minuti"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:241
msgid "It switches itself off after 30 minutes."
msgstr "Si disattiva da sola dopo 30 minuti."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:258
msgid ""
"This site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS address, so ChatGPT cannot "
"reach it from OpenAI's cloud. Use a terminal tool from the sidebar instead, "
"or set the WordPress Site Address to a tunnel or staging URL."
msgstr ""
"Questo sito non sembra trovarsi a un indirizzo HTTPS pubblico, quindi "
"ChatGPT non può raggiungerlo dal cloud di OpenAI. Usare invece uno strumento "
"da terminale dalla barra laterale, oppure impostare l’indirizzo del sito "
"WordPress su un URL di tunnel o di staging."

#. translators: %s: AI app name, e.g. Perplexity
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:262
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS address, so %s cannot "
"reach it from the vendor's cloud. Use a terminal tool from the sidebar "
"instead, or set the WordPress Site Address to a tunnel or staging URL."
msgstr "Questo sito non sembra avere un indirizzo HTTPS pubblico, quindi %s non può raggiungerlo dal cloud del fornitore. Usa invece uno strumento da terminale dalla barra laterale, oppure imposta l’indirizzo del sito WordPress su un tunnel o un URL di staging."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:264
msgid ""
"This site does not appear to be on a public HTTPS address, so the Claude "
"apps cannot reach it from Anthropic's cloud. Use a terminal tool or Claude "
"Desktop from the sidebar instead, or set the WordPress Site Address to a "
"tunnel or staging URL."
msgstr ""
"Questo sito non sembra trovarsi a un indirizzo HTTPS pubblico, quindi le app "
"Claude non possono raggiungerlo dal cloud di Anthropic. Usare invece uno "
"strumento da terminale o Claude Desktop dalla barra laterale, oppure "
"impostare l’indirizzo del sito WordPress su un URL di tunnel o di staging."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:275
msgid "Already added, or on a Team or Enterprise plan?"
msgstr "Già aggiunto, o con un piano Team o Enterprise?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:278
msgid ""
"Already added? Claude reports that a connector with this URL already exists. "
"Find it under <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong> and click "
"<strong>Connect</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Già aggiunto? Claude segnala che esiste già un connettore con questo URL. Lo "
"si trova in <strong>Customize → Connectors</strong>: fare clic su "
"<strong>Connect</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:279
msgid ""
"Custom connectors work on every Claude plan (Free is limited to one). On "
"Team and Enterprise, an organization owner adds the connector first under "
"<strong>Organization settings → Connectors</strong>; members then click "
"<strong>Connect</strong>."
msgstr ""
"I connettori personalizzati funzionano con tutti i piani Claude (Free è "
"limitato a uno). Su Team ed Enterprise, un proprietario dell'organizzazione "
"aggiunge prima il connettore in <strong>Organization settings → Connectors</"
"strong>; i membri fanno poi clic su <strong>Connect</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:281
msgid "Organization owner on Team or Enterprise?"
msgstr "Proprietario di un’organizzazione Team o Enterprise?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:282
msgid "Add it for your organization"
msgstr "Aggiungilo per la tua organizzazione"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:297
msgid ""
"Site actually on a public HTTPS address? Use the cloud connector instead"
msgstr ""
"Il sito è in realtà su un indirizzo HTTPS pubblico? Usa invece il connettore "
"cloud"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:327
msgid ""
"This opens a secure sign-in so ChatGPT can connect without a terminal. No "
"access is granted until you approve it in your browser."
msgstr ""
"Verrà aperto un accesso sicuro affinché ChatGPT possa connettersi senza "
"terminale. Nessun accesso viene concesso finché non viene approvato nel "
"browser."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:328
msgid ""
"This opens a secure sign-in so the Claude apps can connect without a "
"terminal. No access is granted until you approve it in your browser."
msgstr ""
"Verrà aperto un accesso sicuro affinché le app Claude possano connettersi "
"senza terminale. Nessun accesso viene concesso finché non viene approvato "
"nel browser."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:330
msgid "Add it in ChatGPT"
msgstr "Aggiungerlo in ChatGPT"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:331
msgid "Add it in the Claude app"
msgstr "Aggiungerlo nell'app Claude"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:332
msgid "Add it on claude.ai"
msgstr "Aggiungerlo su claude.ai"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:335
msgid ""
"ChatGPT opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong>. Click "
"<strong>Approve</strong>, then pick your site under <strong>+ → Developer "
"mode</strong> in a chat."
msgstr ""
"ChatGPT apre una pagina di accesso sul <strong>tuo sito</strong>. Fare clic "
"su <strong>Approva</strong>, poi scegliere il sito in <strong>+ → Modalità "
"sviluppatore</strong> in una chat."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:336
msgid ""
"Claude opens a sign-in page on <strong>your site</strong>. Click "
"<strong>Approve</strong>, then switch the connector on under <strong>+ → "
"Connectors</strong> in a chat."
msgstr ""
"Claude apre una pagina di accesso sul <strong>tuo sito</strong>. Fare clic "
"su <strong>Approva</strong>, poi attivare il connettore in <strong>+ → "
"Connettori</strong> in una chat."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:350
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:354
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:493
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:500
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:572
msgid "Turn on browser sign-in"
msgstr "Attiva l’accesso dal browser"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:363
msgid "Add it to Claude"
msgstr "Aggiungi a Claude"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:364
msgid "Add to Claude"
msgstr "Aggiungi a Claude"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:368
msgid ""
"Opens claude.ai with this site filled in. Check the address, then click "
"<strong>Continue</strong> and <strong>Add</strong>. The connector shows up "
"in the Claude app too."
msgstr ""
"Apre claude.ai con questo sito già compilato. Controllare l’indirizzo, poi "
"fare clic su <strong>Continua</strong> e <strong>Aggiungi</strong>. Il "
"connettore compare anche nell’app Claude."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:369
msgid ""
"Opens claude.ai with this site filled in. Check the address, then click "
"<strong>Continue</strong> and <strong>Add</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Apre claude.ai con questo sito già compilato. Controllare l’indirizzo, poi "
"fare clic su <strong>Continua</strong> e <strong>Aggiungi</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:374
msgid "Add it by hand instead"
msgstr "Aggiungerlo a mano"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:377
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:404
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:410
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:529
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:536
msgid "Connection link"
msgstr "Link di connessione"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:377
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:404
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:410
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:529
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:536
msgid "Copy connector URL"
msgstr "Copia URL del connettore"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:383
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:427
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:548
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:892
msgid "Approve access"
msgstr "Approvare l'accesso"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:392
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:396
msgid "Open ChatGPT"
msgstr "Apri ChatGPT"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:398
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:517
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:613
msgid "(opens in a new tab)"
msgstr "(si apre in una nuova scheda)"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:400
msgid "Connection link copied — paste it into ChatGPT as the MCP server URL."
msgstr ""
"Link di connessione copiato — incollalo in ChatGPT come URL del server MCP."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:401
msgid "Copies your connection link and opens ChatGPT in a new tab."
msgstr "Copia il link di connessione e apre ChatGPT in una nuova scheda."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:403
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:528
msgid "Copy the link yourself"
msgstr "Copia il link manualmente"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:408
#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:534
msgid "Copy your connection link"
msgstr "Copiare il link di connessione"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:417
msgid ""
"Go to <code>chatgpt.com</code> and sign in (MCP apps work on the web only)."
msgstr ""
"Andare su <code>chatgpt.com</code> e accedere (le app MCP funzionano solo "
"sul web)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:418
msgid ""
"Under <code>Settings → Security and login</code>, turn on <strong>Developer "
"mode</strong> (once)."
msgstr ""
"In <code>Impostazioni → Sicurezza e accesso</code>, attivare la "
"<strong>Modalità sviluppatore</strong> (una sola volta)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:419
msgid ""
"Go to <code>Plugins</code>, click <strong>+</strong> and choose <strong>Add "
"custom MCP server</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Vai a <code>Plugins</code>, fai clic su <strong>+</strong> e scegli "
"<strong>Aggiungi server MCP personalizzato</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:420
msgid ""
"Name it, paste the link as the <strong>MCP server URL</strong>, set "
"Authentication to <strong>OAuth</strong> and create it."
msgstr ""
"Assegnare un nome, incollare il link come <strong>URL del server MCP</"
"strong>, impostare l’autenticazione su <strong>OAuth</strong> e crearlo."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:431
msgid "Which ChatGPT plans work?"
msgstr "Quali piani ChatGPT funzionano?"

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:432
msgid ""
"Requires a ChatGPT <strong>Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise or Edu</strong> "
"plan, on the web. On Business and Enterprise workspaces an admin has to "
"allow Developer mode first."
msgstr ""
"Richiede un piano ChatGPT <strong>Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise o Edu</"
"strong>, sul web. Negli spazi di lavoro Business ed Enterprise un "
"amministratore deve prima consentire Developer mode."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:450
msgid "Go to <code>perplexity.ai</code> in your browser and sign in."
msgstr "Vai su <code>perplexity.ai</code> nel browser e accedi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:451
msgid ""
"Open <strong>Account settings → Connectors</strong> and click <strong>+ "
"Custom connector</strong>."
msgstr "Apri <strong>Account settings → Connectors</strong> e fai clic su <strong>+ Custom connector</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:452
msgid ""
"Choose <strong>Remote</strong>, give it a name, paste the link from step 1 "
"as the server URL, set Authentication to <strong>OAuth</strong> and the "
"transport to <strong>Streamable HTTP</strong>, then save."
msgstr "Scegli <strong>Remote</strong>, assegna un nome, incolla il link del passaggio 1 come URL del server, imposta Authentication su <strong>OAuth</strong> e il trasporto su <strong>Streamable HTTP</strong>, poi salva."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:454
msgid "Requires a Perplexity <strong>Pro, Max or Enterprise</strong> plan."
msgstr "Richiede un piano Perplexity <strong>Pro, Max o Enterprise</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:458
msgid "Go to <code>grok.com/connectors</code> and sign in."
msgstr "Vai su <code>grok.com/connectors</code> e accedi."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:459
msgid ""
"Click <strong>New Connector</strong>, choose <strong>Custom</strong> and "
"paste the link from step 1 as the server URL (Streamable HTTP)."
msgstr "Fai clic su <strong>New Connector</strong>, scegli <strong>Custom</strong> e incolla il link del passaggio 1 come URL del server (Streamable HTTP)."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:460
msgid "Save — Grok starts the sign-in right away."
msgstr "Salva: Grok avvia subito l’accesso."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:462
msgid ""
"Custom connectors are available on Grok's paid plans. On Business and "
"Enterprise workspaces an admin provisions the connector first."
msgstr "I connettori personalizzati sono disponibili nei piani a pagamento di Grok. Negli spazi di lavoro Business ed Enterprise un amministratore deve prima predisporre il connettore."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:466
msgid ""
"Go to <code>gemini.google.com</code> and sign in with a <strong>personal</"
"strong> Google account."
msgstr "Vai su <code>gemini.google.com</code> e accedi con un account Google <strong>personale</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:467
msgid ""
"Open <strong>Settings → Connected apps → Custom apps</strong> and click "
"<strong>Add a custom app</strong>."
msgstr "Apri <strong>Settings → Connected apps → Custom apps</strong> e fai clic su <strong>Add a custom app</strong>."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:468
msgid ""
"Paste the link from step 1 as the MCP server URL and continue — Gemini opens "
"the sign-in page."
msgstr "Incolla il link del passaggio 1 come URL del server MCP e continua: Gemini apre la pagina di accesso."

#: admin/class-mcp-admin-connections.php:470
msgid ""
"Free. Custom apps are a Google beta: United States only, personal accounts, "
"18+, English, with Gemini Apps Activity turned on."
